## Module Lifecycle Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI as CLI Command
    participant RM as runModule()
    participant Mod as Module Instance
    participant MGR as eBPF Manager
    participant Base as Module Base

    CLI->>RM: runModule(moduleName, config)
    RM->>RM: setModConfig(globalConf)
    RM->>Mod: modFunc() - factory
    RM->>Mod: Init(ctx, logger, config, writer)

    Mod->>Mod: detectTarget()
    Mod->>Mod: selectBytecode()
    Mod-->>RM: Init complete

    RM->>Base: Run()
    Base->>Mod: Start()

    Mod->>Mod: setupManagers()
    Mod->>MGR: InitWithOptions(bytecode)
    MGR->>MGR: Load eBPF programs
    Mod->>MGR: Start()
    MGR->>MGR: Attach probes

    Mod->>Mod: initDecodeFun()
    Mod-->>Base: Start complete

    Base->>Base: readEvents()

    loop Event Loop
        MGR-->>Base: eBPF event
        Base->>Mod: Decode(map, bytes)
        Mod-->>Base: IEventStruct
        Base->>Mod: Dispatcher(event)
        Mod->>Mod: handleEvent()
    end

    CLI->>Mod: Close()
    Mod->>MGR: Stop(CleanAll)
    MGR->>MGR: Detach probes
    Mod->>Base: Close()
```

