## 模块生命周期流程

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI as CLI 命令
    participant RM as runModule()
    participant Mod as 模块实例
    participant MGR as eBPF 管理器
    participant Base as Module 基类

    CLI->>RM: runModule(moduleName, config)
    RM->>RM: setModConfig(globalConf)
    RM->>Mod: modFunc() - 工厂函数
    RM->>Mod: Init(ctx, logger, config, writer)

    Mod->>Mod: detectTarget()
    Mod->>Mod: selectBytecode()
    Mod-->>RM: Init 完成

    RM->>Base: Run()
    Base->>Mod: Start()

    Mod->>Mod: setupManagers()
    Mod->>MGR: InitWithOptions(bytecode)
    MGR->>MGR: 加载 eBPF 程序
    Mod->>MGR: Start()
    MGR->>MGR: 附加探针

    Mod->>Mod: initDecodeFun()
    Mod-->>Base: Start 完成

    Base->>Base: readEvents()

    loop 事件循环
        MGR-->>Base: eBPF 事件
        Base->>Mod: Decode(map, bytes)
        Mod-->>Base: IEventStruct
        Base->>Mod: Dispatcher(event)
        Mod->>Mod: handleEvent()
    end

    CLI->>Mod: Close()
    Mod->>MGR: Stop(CleanAll)
    MGR->>MGR: 分离探针
    Mod->>Base: Close()
```

